{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mXnp5aW6Mk1793284004.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美股三大指數均低開，道指和納指一開市就下挫逾300點。</p><p></p><p>道指一開市跌至52,000點邊緣，其後跌幅逐步收窄。納指曾經急挫近500點，跌幅約百分之1.8，落到26,000點水平。</p><p></p><p>科技股個別發展，谷歌母公司Alphabet自由現金流負值擴大，股價早段急挫約一成三。微軟首季度業績好過預期，股價則上升逾百分之1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:01:17.660627+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:58:21.470372+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:58:22.141891+00:00","content_hash":"cdd781402a3a59f8954dc1192d03297911a62e67b791d15a34043a67fc6237d2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:01:17.660627+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}